&none  &mt RIGHT_SHIFT Z  &kp X     &kp C     &kp V       &kp B        &kp ESC         &kp DELETE     &kp N       &kp M  &kp COMMA  &kp DOT   &mt RIGHT_SHIFT FSLH  &none
&none  &kp LCTRL          &kp LGUI  &kp LALT  &lt 7 BSPC  &lt 3 SPACE  &lt 4 CAPSLOCK  &mt RCTRL TAB  &lt 2 BSPC  &none  &none      &kp HOME  &kp END               &none
            >;
