&none  &kp LGUI           &kp LALT  &kp LCTRL  &lt 7 BSPC  &lt 11 SPACE  &lt 14 CAPSLOCK  &mt RGUI TAB  &lt 2 BSPC  &none  &none      &kp HOME  &kp END               &none
